<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Dear,<br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">Thank you for your interest in the <strong>Publicly Funded In-Vitro Fertilization Program</strong>. The Ministry of Health has reviewed your application (</span></span></span></span>{{{Case.CaseNumber}}}<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:115%"><span lang="EN-CA">) and determined it is <strong>not eligible </strong>based on the following program criteria:</span></span></span></span>
<ul style="margin-bottom:11px">
	<li style="margin-bottom:11px; margin-left:8px"><span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span lang="EN-CA" style="font-size:11.0pt"><span style="line-height:115%">All applicants must have active Medical Services Plan (MSP) coverage for the full duration of the 12-month funding period (i.e., MSP coverage does not have a cancellation date within the next 12 months)</span></span></span></li>
</ul>
<span style="font-family:Tomaha,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"> <span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">We understand this decision may be disappointing. This does not impact your ability to apply again in the future if all program criteria are met.</span></span></span><br />
<br />
<span style="font-size:12pt"><span style="line-height:normal"><span lang="EN-CA">Sincerely,</span></span></span><br />
